    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d968">

                <pb facs="0742" n="626" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg626"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/13875.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Bonney to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">San Luis Potosi</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-11-23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 23, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>San Luis Potosí is now the temporary capital of Mexico. Convention troops have
                    advanced easterly and southerly.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bonney</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
